  "_comment2": "Embedding entries carry retrieval.defaultSimilarityThreshold because a cosine score is only meaningful relative to the model that produced it. Measured on the same query/passage pair: ~0.73 on gemini-embedding-2, ~0.40 on the local hashed embedder. A single global threshold would therefore be wrong for at least one of them -- at 0.55 the local embedder returns nothing, at 0.15 Gemini returns everything. Thresholds are re-measured when a model is added; see docs/PROVIDER_NOTES.md."
